{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/radiant-square-Radiant-al-reem-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":523,"crm_id":"616","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Radiant Square","slug":"radiant-square-Radiant-al-reem-island","display_address":"Al Reem Island","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"Radiant","price":1993000,"display_price":"1.99M","lattitude":24.4974,"longitude":54.404442,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Radiant Square on Al Reem Island in Abu Dhabi is a residential project consisting of five towers combining residential, retail, commercial and entertainment facilities. Designed to meet the diverse needs of its residents, Radiant Square includes more than 1,200 residences, three swimming pools, a variety of shops, a children's area, a gym, and various restaurants and cafes.</p><p>This vibrant location on Al Reem Island, also known as the City of Lights, offers a variety of elegant <strong>1-5 bedroom residences as well as duplexes.</strong> All apartments feature functional layouts and understated, contemporary design. Each residence has 1-2 balconies or spacious terraces with magnificent views of the Arabian Gulf and the city.</p><p>Spacious lobbies seamlessly connect all towers and high-speed lifts provide quick access. The bedrooms in this project feature spacious contemporary design, elegant aesthetics and the use of premium materials, creating the perfect space for relaxation.</p><p>With easy access to motorways, residents have easy access to key locations on and off the island.</p><p>Within walking distance of Radiant Square are SPAR Express, Waitrose, Carrefour and Al Maya supermarkets. Reem Mall, Galleria Mall and Shams Boutik are some of the Emirate's largest shopping centres within a 5-minute drive. As well as shopping, there are plenty of leisure and entertainment options including cinemas, Arabic, Indian and European restaurants, an art centre and more.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/616/images/2023/12/18/FIjywmjGnMKEqaYOxt2BUMFxX4EmUYxh9ebNEae6.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/18/FIjywmjGnMKEqaYOxt2BUMFxX4EmUYxh9ebNEae6.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/616/images/2023/12/18/2dHJ5hNwJiXIzxC9CoxiWMfZWDZ04P2oOSNRZhQ7.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/18/2dHJ5hNwJiXIzxC9CoxiWMfZWDZ04P2oOSNRZhQ7.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/616/images/2023/12/18/ZxnJ033YGgbDXyLtSdtMcbfAjNQMrYCptqqLzCkE.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/18/ZxnJ033YGgbDXyLtSdtMcbfAjNQMrYCptqqLzCkE.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/616/images/2023/12/18/39DdXUYhJWGK35CV4Fgw5LrTPcYMtqwkxOzn0Sqy.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/18/39DdXUYhJWGK35CV4Fgw5LrTPcYMtqwkxOzn0Sqy.png","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/616/images/2023/12/18/pE7KmPyLYk8j9Byzx3E7OLWTHEDEYCeunsA1FAde.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/18/pE7KmPyLYk8j9Byzx3E7OLWTHEDEYCeunsA1FAde.png","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/616/images/2023/12/18/pklTe1lPjzh0CFOFuSSbPYVJvwm0qzBYUxse1R79.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/18/pklTe1lPjzh0CFOFuSSbPYVJvwm0qzBYUxse1R79.png","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/616/images/2023/12/18/kUfreSM7X4K0faql51j72ZDqERtjyjSDgPWQyAco.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/18/kUfreSM7X4K0faql51j72ZDqERtjyjSDgPWQyAco.png","__ggfxIndex":6}],"characteristics_